1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,430
Stare at the center and the dots disappear?

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,200
Look only at the center cross (+)
for 16 seconds

3
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:10,450
The trick is to keep your eyes still!

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,220
Don't look away from the center +

5
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:21,220
Are the dots fading?

6
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:27,220
Keep looking at the center!

7
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,790
Did the pink dots disappear?

8
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:33,960
Blink,
and they come back

9
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:37,930
Eye cells react strongly
to things that change

10
00:00:37,980 --> 00:00:42,230
If nothing changes,
they send weaker and weaker signals

11
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:46,600
Where the signal goes quiet,
your brain fills in the color around it

12
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:50,600
Your eyes actually jiggle a little.
A sharp dot "changes" every time

13
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:55,200
A blurry dot barely changes when they jiggle,
so it fades quickly

14
00:00:55,250 --> 00:00:57,050
That's all five Secrets of the Eye!

15
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,350
NEXT: You can't read with the corner of your eye?
